{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n こんばちは\n \n スニーカーが好きなのですが、\n 欲しくなるのはいつも白色。\n 白色以外の靴に運命感じるのを\n 気長に待つとします。\n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n 今年の夏！！\n 8月3日「TOKYO IDOL FESTIVAL 2019」\n 9月15日「KOYABU SONIC 2019」\n 9月21日「イナズマロックFES」\n \n に出演させていただきます！！\n とってもとっても嬉しくて楽しみです！！\n 暑い夏にしましょうね〜〜🌞\n \n \n \n あ、新しいアーティスト写真が公開されました！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34BTDMXMASJAHX8B5VES2Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n きょんちゃんがみーぱんの次に盛れてるって\n 褒めてくれたのでお気に入りです🧚‍♀️\n チェックしてね〜〜\n \n \n \n 少し昔の6月23日の握手会のお話。\n \n 🐡4部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34BVF137QJT43YBJK7X2W0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34BWHGJ53ERJ8MGNYGA67C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34BXGGRA7AWEGEK29F6NNC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n テーマは\n 「砂浜デート🏖あ、バッグお家に忘れちゃった！」\n でした。\n ワンピースも空色のトップスもZARAです！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34BYG9Q1G7NK3ZMJCEPFJR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34BZGJJ3D8JS82EPSTTJKA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n あいもかわらずピン留めにはまってます。\n 5部はポニーテールしました〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C0GEP5T8ARJ64X6WJG06","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 生写真の撮影で毎回やってるけど\n 採用されたことないポーズ🙄（笑）\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C1M2MS26F26VME5YGDHV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C2KRMNQHDBG6A745FPMB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C3KXSSQY8SRF032RWHTF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C4K5RRNCCVRXSZ5TQDWT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C5JQXT7JYME18977JNGY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C6NZ9JC6ZXT8ZX56VGST","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 素敵なお花もありがとうございます🌸\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C7N1SZ9QFE3GJXWE24WY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n そういえばこの日のとしちゃん、\n 前髪あげてってお願いしたらしてくれた😚\n \n \n \n 明日は「THE MUSIC DAY」に\n 出演させていただきます！\n みてくださいね〜〜🤗\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ34C8QPR67WRSHGE0348S6S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}